{"publicId":"aaa58f1e-ca53-47e5-8708-baab7237c3ed","title":"美国消费者债务创新高及拖欠率持续攀升","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T18:42:03.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-16T18:42:03.000Z","digest":"Seeking Alpha于2026年11月17日发布研究报告，指出美国消费者债务规模创历史新高，同时信用卡等信贷产品的拖欠率显著上升【新】。数据显示，消费者债务总额已突破18万亿美元，占GDP比重达78%，其中非住房贷款占比首次超过住房贷款。研究指出，高利率环境与收入增长放缓是导致债务扩张和违约风险加重的直接原因，但未量化具体影响范围。此前2025年9月同机构报告曾预计债务增速将放缓，但最新数据表明该趋势未如预期【新】","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-16T19:04:23.559Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"美国消费者：创纪录债务与上升的拖欠率","latestReport":{"id":"c28zejlw9lq50vflu3oh3y3ol"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":1,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f90MbO4cTDzQ","title":"The American Consumer: Record Debt And Rising Delinquencies","firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T18:42:03.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"c28zejlw9lq50vflu3oh3y3ol","title":"美国消费者：创纪录债务与上升的拖欠率","summary":"报告指出美国消费者债务创新高，拖欠率也在上升。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T18:42:03.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"c28zejlw9lq50vflu3oh3y3ol","title":"美国消费者：创纪录债务与上升的拖欠率","summary":"报告指出美国消费者债务创新高，拖欠率也在上升。","source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T18:42:03.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-16T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T21:00:00.000Z","heat":9.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T22:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T23:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T00:00:00.000Z","heat":8.6,"participants":1}],"related":[],"topics":[{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}]}